# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day24

## Topic
# 능동태 vs 수동태
### Active Voice / Passive Voice

---

## 1. 능동태

주어가 직접 행동을 하는 경우

### Structure

주어 + 동사 + 목적어

### Example

The manager **approved** the proposal.

→ 관리자가 제안서를 승인했다.

---

## 2. 수동태

주어가 행동을 받는 경우

### Structure

주어 + be + p.p.

### Example

The proposal **was approved** by the manager.

→ 제안서는 관리자에 의해 승인되었다.

---

## 3. 시제별 수동태

### 현재

am / is / are + p.p.

The report **is reviewed** every month.

---

### 과거

was / were + p.p.

The report **was reviewed** yesterday.

---

### 현재완료

has / have been + p.p.

The report **has been reviewed**.

---

### 미래

will be + p.p.

The report **will be reviewed** tomorrow.

---

## 4. TOEIC에서 자주 나오는 형태

### be + p.p.

The documents **were submitted** yesterday.

### have been + p.p.

The documents **have been submitted**.

### will be + p.p.

The documents **will be submitted** tomorrow.

---

## 5. 능동태 vs 수동태 구분

### The manager approved the report.

manager가 행동함
→ 능동태

### The report was approved by the manager.

report가 행동을 받음
→ 수동태

---

## TOEIC Tip

빈칸 뒤에 목적어가 있는지 확인한다.

### 주어가 직접 행동

→ 능동태

### 주어가 행동을 받음

→ 수동태

---

## Important

❌ The report was approved the manager.

✅ The report was approved **by** the manager.

---

## Quick Comparison

| 형태 | 구조 |
|---|---|
| 능동태 | S + V + O |
| 현재 수동 | S + am/is/are + p.p. |
| 과거 수동 | S + was/were + p.p. |
| 현재완료 수동 | S + has/have been + p.p. |
| 미래 수동 | S + will be + p.p. |
